// # Computational Neuroscience & Brain-Computer Interface (BCI) Facade
//
// Logline: Unified facade re-exporting biophysical neurons, synaptic plasticity, neural mass dynamics, spike sorting, EEG processing, and BCI decoders.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and facade importing all 49 neuro_bci companion submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular Computational Neuroscience and Brain-Computer Interface subcomponents.
//   2. Re-export public constructors, dynamical steppers, spectral filters, and decoders.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility with downstream openOODA callers.

